"nothingismagick","id":35242872,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MjQyODcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35242872?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nothingismagick","html_url":"https://github.com/nothingismagick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nothingismagick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nothingismagick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nothingismagick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nothingismagick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nothingismagick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nothingismagick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nothingismagick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nothingismagick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nothingismagick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/comments/822442373","html_url":"https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/1535#issuecomment-822442373","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/1535","id":822442373,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgyMjQ0MjM3Mw==","user":{"login":"lemarier","id":22237916,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjM3OTE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22237916?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemarier","html_url":"https://github.com/lemarier","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemarier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemarier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemarier/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemarier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemarier/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemarier/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemarier/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemarier/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemarier/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-04-19T12:52:31Z","updated_at":"2021-04-19T13:18:02Z","body":"Following on `updater should never allow versions older than the \"minted timestamp\" of the current version to be installed`\r\n\r\nActually, the update server should determine whether an update is required based on the [update request](https://tauri.studio/en/docs/usage/howtos/updater#update-requests). This allows rollback or fine-grained updating sequence if required. (By example rollback to v1 only for win64) -- this append sometimes that you ship a bad update and you should be able to roll back till you burn a fix.\r\n\r\nIf you run version `1.2.3` and you check for a new update, and the last version is `1.2.3`, the server SHOULD announce `204` (no-content) -- [more details](https://tauri.studio/en/docs/usage/howtos/updater#server-support)\r\n\r\nFor the `minted timestamp` this is something we can implement but will remove rollback functionalities. \r\n\r\nThanks!\r\n\r\nEdit: Maybe we could implement it for [static JSON](https://tauri.studio/en/docs/usage/howtos/updater/#update-file-json-format) but will remove rollback so not ideal...\r\n\r\nEdit 2: What we could do is add an optional `timestamp` field on the static and server support, and if provided, we make sure that the current binary timestamp is older than the announced timestamp. This makes the security check optional, so if you need rollback you can disable the timestamp check then announce the rollback.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/comments/822442373/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"lemarier","id":22237916,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjM3OTE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22237916?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemarier","html_url":"https://github.com/lemarier","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemarier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemarier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemarier/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemarier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemarier/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemarier/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemarier/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemarier/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemarier/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/comments/824155229","html_url":"https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/1535#issuecomment-824155229","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/1535","id":824155229,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgyNDE1NTIyOQ==","user":{"login":"nothingismagick","id":35242872,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MjQyODcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35242872?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nothingismagick","html_url":"https://github.com/nothingismagick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nothingismagick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nothingismagick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nothingismagick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nothingismagick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nothingismagick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nothingismagick/orgs","repos_url":"